    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nIconic West Cork Coastline Property\n\nSavills are delighted to present Sea House, Harbour View, Kilbrittain, West Cork, an iconic West Cork coastline property with panoramic south facing sea views overlooking the corner of Courtmacsherry Bay and the Old Head of Kinsale.\n\nUpon arrival, you are guided by an inviting driveway into the property, where you become immediately aware of the stunning views on offer from the site. The driveway arrives at a large parking area where you can also access a large, elevated rear garden which is laid in lawn. \n\nThe original Georgian period property has been extended on the ground floor and is currently laid out as a bar/restaurant area, which could be converted back into residential use. This space is open plan and commands majestic sea views and can easily access the south facing patio and gardens. Here, you get an immense sense of space, light and privacy. \n\nThe building can be accessed via the original front door or through the glass panelled double doors leading into the bar/restaurant area. Here, you will also find a commercial kitchen towards the rear of the property, storerooms, male/female and disabled lavatories.\n\nMaking your way upstairs the main house, you are greeted by a bathroom on the return of the stairs. From here you will find six bedrooms, three of which are flooded with natural light and offer spectacular sea and coastline views. \n\nThe location of Sea House is ideal for exploring West Cork and Kerry whilst the popular Harbour View beach (Radharc Na Chuain) is within a short stroll where one can enjoy sea swimming, horse riding and bracing coastal walks.\n\nContact us today to discuss this very rare opportunity."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Spectacular coastal property</li><li>Approx. 425 sq m / 4575 sq ft</li><li>About 1.9 acres</li><li>Uninterrupted south facing sea views</li><li>Detached garage </li><li>Potential to convert to a private residence</li><li>Self contained one bedroom apartment</li><li>Mains services / OFCH</ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Michael O'Donovan"
      }
    ],
